{"title":"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay B Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Replace <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> below with the number you receive.\n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is input into the flowchart below, what is the output?\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Dividing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Multiplying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/c/59c18ecb55d353cdeef890e8f51bf3397a720657.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"14\" />, and subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> from this gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/c/74c8edfb57e6f109ee1fab0bdc3f45d1f67d06a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13N - 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"68\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay B Problem 1\">player 1</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/0/0009dc22fa07f7cca840e7ad45abf9456c41c684.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />. This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/c/74c8edfb57e6f109ee1fab0bdc3f45d1f67d06a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13N - 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"68\" height=\"16\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/0/060080e0123682d3f4b303c390a9218d7f8bcf2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13 \\times 8 - 6 = 104 - 6 = \\boxed{98}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"219\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC\">2023 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay B Problem 1\">Relay B Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_3\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay B Problem 3\">Relay B Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1&amp;act